        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a vast desert, you find only one path forward: the towering mountain known as Bael’s Rock. Within, ancient trials and cryptic puzzles await – ready to challenge you at every step toward the summit. Test your wits to uncover long-buried secrets and the truth behind the shadowy figure who brought you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bael’s Rock</i> is a <strong>parser-based</strong> <strong>text adventure </strong>inspired by the cult classic <i>Zork</i>. Experience the interactive fiction genre that gave birth to point-and-click games - reimagined for modern players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike simplified choice-based games, you’re not limited to predefined options. <strong>You control your character freely, typing your own commands to interact with the world.</strong> Examine your surroundings, search for and combine items, manipulate strange mechanisms, and solve puzzles – all through your own ideas and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.poster.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.webm?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.mp4?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting and Structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Bael’s Rock</i> blends fantasy with light steampunk elements – a mysterious backdrop filled with secrets, puzzles, and hidden lore. <strong>The journey is divided into seven chapters, each presenting new challenges to overcome</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.poster.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.webm?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.mp4?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter introduces the story and serves as a tutorial, guiding you through the basics. From there, you're on your own to tackle increasingly complex puzzles as you carve your path toward the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bael’s Rock</i> offers <strong>a considerable challenge in the spirit of cult classics</strong> – demanding, yet intuitive to play. As a fully text-based experience, <strong>it requires patience, focus, and a love for reading</strong>. If you're not into puzzles, story-driven exploration, or point-and-click-style logic, this probably isn't the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro mode/High contrast/Accessibility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a retro mode with no graphics and a focus on readability. Additionally, the entire game is fully playable and functional without sound, as it features only minor and entirely optional sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/3787bffe006841c1fb0b6e8ce60c25c9.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost in a vast desert, you find only one path forward: the towering mountain known as Bael’s Rock. Within, ancient trials and cryptic puzzles await – ready to challenge you at every step toward the summit. Test your wits to uncover long-buried secrets and the truth behind the shadowy figure who brought you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bael’s Rock</i> is a <strong>parser-based</strong> <strong>text adventure </strong>inspired by the cult classic <i>Zork</i>. Experience the interactive fiction genre that gave birth to point-and-click games - reimagined for modern players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike simplified choice-based games, you’re not limited to predefined options. <strong>You control your character freely, typing your own commands to interact with the world.</strong> Examine your surroundings, search for and combine items, manipulate strange mechanisms, and solve puzzles – all through your own ideas and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.poster.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.webm?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6cbdddaca2ad07f006f82a24509aeb1d.mp4?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting and Structure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <i>Bael’s Rock</i> blends fantasy with light steampunk elements – a mysterious backdrop filled with secrets, puzzles, and hidden lore. <strong>The journey is divided into seven chapters, each presenting new challenges to overcome</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.poster.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.webm?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/6d1715145086fe74a8b8ca2c6f76f7a5.mp4?t=1770229371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first chapter introduces the story and serves as a tutorial, guiding you through the basics. From there, you're on your own to tackle increasingly complex puzzles as you carve your path toward the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bael’s Rock</i> offers <strong>a considerable challenge in the spirit of cult classics</strong> – demanding, yet intuitive to play. As a fully text-based experience, <strong>it requires patience, focus, and a love for reading</strong>. If you're not into puzzles, story-driven exploration, or point-and-click-style logic, this probably isn't the game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro mode/High contrast/Accessibility</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a retro mode with no graphics and a focus on readability. Additionally, the entire game is fully playable and functional without sound, as it features only minor and entirely optional sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694940/extras/3787bffe006841c1fb0b6e8ce60c25c9.avif?t=1770229371\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p>",
